@{ViewData["Title"]="Troque sua senha inicial";}
<section class="para-shell para-section"><span class="para-eyebrow">MNSOFT · ACESSO SEGURO</span><h1 class="para-editorial-title">Sua conta, sua senha.</h1><p>Defina uma nova senha antes de acessar o painel. Use ao menos 14 caracteres, maiúsculas, minúsculas, números e símbolo.</p><form method="post" action="/admin/change-password" class="panel">@Html.AntiForgeryToken()<div asp-validation-summary="All"></div><label for="current">Senha atual</label><input id="current" type="password" name="currentPassword" autocomplete="current-password" required maxlength="1024"/><label for="password">Nova senha</label><input id="password" type="password" name="password" autocomplete="new-password" required minlength="14" maxlength="1024"/><label for="confirmation">Repita a nova senha</label><input id="confirmation" type="password" name="confirmation" autocomplete="new-password" required maxlength="1024"/><button class="para-button">Salvar senha e entrar novamente</button></form></section>
